        "research_rationale": "Identity: the registered original is the Federal Register printing of Executive Order 12376 (47 FR 34349, Federal Register of August 9, 1982; govinfo PDF text layer, grade original_representation_unverified, recorded as acceptable as original), headed Presidential Commission on Drunk Driving and signed August 5, 1982. It increases the membership ceiling of the Presidential Commission on Drunk Driving. Inventory: one amending sentence, confirmed against the full held text. Ending: Executive Order 12553 of February 25, 1986 (51 FR 7237, Federal Register of March 3, 1986; held government printing) revokes the orders listed in its table, and any amendments thereto; its enacting provision has no stated effective date, so the first end is dated on signing, 1986-02-25 (a reading, disclosed for the reviewer). The Federal Register publication and filing dates are not effective dates. The table lists 12376, whose subject line describes increasing membership on the Presidential Commission on Drunk Driving. The order has no sunset of its own.  The packet’s number-citation lookup over the held order texts (33,118 readable files) found no held text citing this order by number other than its own printings. Searches: the OFR executive-order catalog search and the USC and eCFR citation searches were selected after reading their coverage notes (complete; no coverage warning; the USC edition runs through 2026-10-09 and the eCFR search to 2026-10-14, which cannot matter for an order whose end is shown in 1986 or earlier).\nMember checks: {\"earlier_end_check\":\"Candidate earlier ends examined. (1) Executive Order 12415 extended the parent Commission to December 31, 1983 by amending section 4(b) of the parent; it does not amend or revoke this order (source note). (2) Whether the parent Commission ended before 1986 is not established and, as an event that does not name this order, is a disclosed candidate only (owner ruling 2026-10-21). No held order revokes or supersedes this order before EO 12553. The packet’s number-citation lookup over the held order texts (33,118 readable files) found no held text citing this order by number other than its own printings.\",\"independent_command_check\":\"Independent commands: none; the order only changes a membership ceiling in the parent order.\",\"savings_check\":\"Savings: The enacting provision of Executive Order 12553 has no savings clause, and a bounded search of the held 12553 text, the order’s own text and the OFR catalog shows no surviving appointment, transfer or right and no continuing independent effect.\",\"scope_check\":\"Scope: the order contains one operative sentence; the dossier inventory matches it.\"}",
